UID:brisbane-dx7m4y@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260904T200000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260905T020000
SUMMARY:Trellis Workspace – A Shared Workspace for Musicians by Casual Se
 quence Group
DESCRIPTION:Trellis Workspace presented by Casual Sequence! A one day trial
  for musicians to come together in a free shared workspace. • Decompress
  after the week of Bigsound. • Try fear-setting\, the famous Tim Ferriss
  method for making big decisions and defining worst case scenarios. • Se
 e how many grants you can apply for in a day. • Complete your tax. • C
 reate a release plan and budget. • Book a show or apply for support slot
 s. • Order your thoughts. On the day we'll run an Ideas Beehive\; an int
 eractive way to brainstorm ideas with other people. Imagine a panel but wi
 th all the lived knowledge of whoever is in the room on the day. Tea\, cof
 fee\, fruit\, and snacks supplied. [button link="https://events.humanitix.
 com/trellis-workspace"]Tickets[/button]
LOCATION:The Cave Inn\, 47 Balaclava St.\, Woolloongabba\, QLD\, 4102
URL:https://thecaveinn.net/events/trellis-workspace-a-shared-workspace-for-
 musicians-by-casual-sequence-group/
END:VEVENT
