BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:brisbane-1u60uo9@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260905T040000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260905T080000
SUMMARY:Kevin Bennett\, Kelly Cork & Jacob Vincent
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an intimate\, soul-stirring night of Australian s
 ongwriting. This powerhouse lineup brings together three masters of musica
 l craft.Heading the bill is Kevin Bennett\, the award-winning Golden Guita
 r legend and driving force behind roots-rock icons Kevin Bennett & The Flo
 od. Renowned as one of the country's most respected Indigenous singer-song
 writers\, Bennett masterfully blends country\, blues\, folk\, and rock int
 o the narrative. Joining him is his long-time musical brother\, Kelly Cork
 . Known for his warm stage presence and evocative\, heartfelt lyrics\, Cor
 k's gift for storytelling has captivated audiences nationwide. Together\, 
 their decades-long friendship brings an unmatched warmth and musicianship 
 to stage. Rounding out this spectacular trio is the incredible Jacob Vince
 nt\, a rising force in the acoustic music scene\, make him the perfect com
 plement to these seasoned storytellers.Do not miss the chance to catch the
 se three incredible artists sharing the stage [button link="https://ticket
 s.oztix.com.au/outlet/event/a5eff86d-1d5f-4309-b87d-7ddebeb17a03"]Tickets[
 /button]
LOCATION:The Cave Inn\, 47 Balaclava St.\, Woolloongabba\, QLD\, 4102
URL:https://thecaveinn.net/events/kevin-bennett-kelly-cork-jacob-vincent/
END:VEVENT
